              visible: SIDES,
              highlighted: ["AB","BC","DE","EF"] },
            { text: "And, first, each of the remaining angles at {C|angC} and {F|angF} less than a right angle.",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["angC","angF"],
              transition: { mode: "parallel", animations: [
                  { elem: "angC", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "angF", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep } ] } },
            { text: "I say that the triangle {ABC|ABCt} is equiangular with the triangle {DEF|DEFt},",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["ABCt","DEFt"] },
            { text: "the angle {ABC|angABC} equals the angle {DEF|angDEF},",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["angABC","angDEF"] },
            { text: "and the remaining angle, namely the angle at {C|angC}, equals the remaining angle, the angle at {F|angF}.",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["angC","angF"] },
            { text: "If the angle {ABC|angABC} does not equal the angle {DEF|angDEF}, then one of them is greater.",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["angABC","angDEF"] },
            { text: "Let the angle {ABC|angABC} be greater.",
              visible: ACUTE,
              highlighted: ["angABC"] },
            { text: "Construct the angle {ABG|angABG} equal to the angle {DEF|angDEF} on the straight line {AB} and at the point {B} on it.",
              visible: CON,
              highlighted: ["angABG","angDEF","AB","B"],
              transition: { mode: "cascade", animations: [
                  { elem: "angABG", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "BG",     name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect },
                  { elem: "G",      name: geomlib.A.Point.appear } ] },
              justifications: [{ claim: "angle ABG = angle DEF", ref: "I.23" }] },
            { text: "Then, since the angle {A|angA} equals {D|angD}, and the angle {ABG|angABG} equals the angle {DEF|angDEF},",
              visible: CON,
              highlighted: ["angA","angD","angABG","angDEF"] },
            { text: "therefore the remaining angle {AGB|angAGB} equals the remaining angle {DFE|angF}.",
