                  { elem: "angC", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                  { elem: "angF", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep } ] } },
            { text: "I say again that, in this case too, the triangle {ABC|ABCt} is equiangular with the triangle {DEF|DEFt}.",
